* Fully differential buffered-cascode OTA for capacitive sampling feedback.
.subckt sampling_feedback_ota vss iref vdd vinn vinp vocm voutn voutp

* Bias reference: 50 uA at iref makes a supply-tracking PMOS bias pbn.
XMNREF  iref  iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=40 nf=8
XMNPB   pbn   iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=40 nf=8
XMPREF  pbn   pbn   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=80 nf=16
CIREF   iref  vss   10p
CBP     pbn   vss   2p

* Low-voltage PMOS cascode bias for the preamplifier active loads.
XMNPBC  pbcas iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=40 nf=8
XMPBC   pbcas pbcas vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=7 nf=1
CPBC    pbcas vss   1p
XMNBP   nbcas pbn   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=80 nf=16
XMNBC   nbcas nbcas vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=1 nf=1
CNBC    nbcas vss   1p

* Long-channel differential preamplifier.  Its local CMFB holds xop/xon at
* pbn so the PMOS output buffers have a reproducible quiescent current.
XMTAIL  ntail iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=320 nf=64
XMINP   ndp   vinp  ntail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMINP2  ndp   vinp  ntail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMINN   ndn   vinn  ntail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMINN2  ndn   vinn  ntail vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMNCP   xop   nbcas ndp   vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=8
XMNCP2  xop   nbcas ndp   vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=8
XMNCN   xon   nbcas ndn   vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=8
XMNCN2  xon   nbcas ndn   vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=40 nf=8
XMPLSP  nsp   pctrl vdd   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=640 nf=128
XMPLSP2 nsp   pctrl vdd   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=640 nf=128
XMPLCP  xop   pbcas nsp   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMPLCP2 xop   pbcas nsp   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMPLSN  nsn   pctrl vdd   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=640 nf=128
XMPLSN2 nsn   pctrl vdd   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=4 w=640 nf=128
XMPLCN  xon   pbcas nsn   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
XMPLCN2 xon   pbcas nsn   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=16
RXP     xop   pbn   10meg
RXN     xon   pbn   10meg

* Local CMFB fixes the preamplifier outputs at the PMOS buffer bias pbn.
RXCP    xop   xcm   10meg
RXCN    xon   xcm   10meg
CXCP    xop   xcm   300f
CXCN    xon   xcm   300f
XPCMT   pct   iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=7 nf=1
XPCM1   pca   xcm   pct vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=14 nf=2
XPCM2   pctrl pbn   pct vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=14 nf=2
XPCP1   pca   pca   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=7 nf=1
XPCP2   pctrl pca   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=7 nf=1
RPCTRL  pctrl iref  200k
CPCTRL  pctrl vss   2p

* Class-A PMOS output buffers.  A rise at vinp lowers xop and raises voutp,
* giving the required positive differential OTA polarity.
XMOP    voutp xop   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=640 nf=128
XMON    voutn xon   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=640 nf=128
XMNOP   voutp ncm  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=640 nf=128
XMNON   voutn ncm  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=640 nf=128
COUTP   voutp vss   4p
COUTN   voutn vss   4p

* Split Miller compensation for the two-stage differential path.
RZP     xop   czp   450
RZN     xon   czn   450
CCP     czp   voutp 6.2p
CCN     czn   voutn 6.2p

* Continuous-time output common-mode feedback.  A 200 uA sensing pair gives
* the CM loop enough authority to cancel simultaneous 50 uA output pulses.
RCMP    voutp vcm   10meg
RCMN    voutn vcm   10meg
CCMP    voutp vcm   300f
CCMN    voutn vcm   300f
XMCMT   cmt   iref  vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=160 nf=32
XMCM1   cma   vcm   cmt vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=320 nf=64
XMCM2   ncm   vocm  cmt vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=320 nf=64
XMCP1   cma   cma   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=160 nf=32
XMCP2   ncm   cma   vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=160 nf=32
RNCM    ncm   iref  1meg
CCM     ncm   vss   300f

.ends sampling_feedback_ota
